     1163        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
     1164        SIZE 7.5 BY .79 NO-UNDO.
     1165   DEFINE VARIABLE t-minparolAdm AS INTEGER FORMAT ">,>>>,>>9":U INITIAL 0
     1166        VIEW-AS FILL-IN
