     1193        SIZE 70 BY 1 NO-UNDO.
     1194   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1195        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
     1196        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
     1197        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 95
     1198        t-noanshftstaff AT ROW 2.17 COL 4
     1199        t-obyznumbukv AT ROW 3.08 COL 4
     1200        t-obyznumbukvAdm AT ROW 4.08 COL 4 WIDGET-ID 14
     1201        t-minparol AT ROW 6.5 COL 72.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 4
     1202        t-minparolAdm AT ROW 6.5 COL 85.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 18
     1203        t-TimeAvail AT ROW 7.5 COL 72.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 6
     1204        t-TimeAvailAdm AT ROW 7.5 COL 85.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 20
     1205        t-TimeBlock AT ROW 8.5 COL 72.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 8
     1206        t-TimeBlockAdm AT ROW 8.5 COL 85.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 22
     1207        t-LastPaswd AT ROW 9.5 COL 72.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 10
     1208        t-LastPaswdAdm AT ROW 9.5 COL 85.5 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 16
     1209        "Пользователь" VIEW-AS TEXT
     1210             SIZE 12 BY .67 AT ROW 5.5 COL 72 WIDGET-ID 12
     1211        "Администратор" VIEW-AS TEXT
     1212             SIZE 14 BY .67 AT ROW 5.5 COL 85 WIDGET-ID 24
     1213        SPACE(0.24) SKIP(4.40)
     1214       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
     1215            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
     1216            TITLE "Параметры работы с пользователями и персоналом"
     1217            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
     1218   ASSIGN
     1219          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
     1220          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
     1221   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1222   DO:
     1223     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
     1224   END.
     1225   ON CHOOSE OF B-exit IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1226   DO:
     1227     RUN proc-save IN THIS-PROCEDURE NO-ERROR.
     1228     IF ERROR-STATUS:ERROR THEN RETURN NO-APPLY.
     1229   END.
